    "head_commit_message": "feat(content): cut the definitions to what presentation reads (spec 39 step 9e-ii) (#722)\n\nUnitArms, BattleTuning, ContentRegistry, ArmourDef, StructurePlanDef and\nStructureFaceDef go, with ContentStore's tuning, armour and plan_from_export.\nUnitDef, ItemDef and WeaponDef keep only what the wave form panel reads, and\nNodeDef drops its plan. The crate keeps every schema field a class doesn't\ndeclare in the object's schema_kept metadata and writes it back, so saving a\nmap through MapFiles.write loses none. The scan of the traits the code reads\nmoves to cargo.\n\nWaived-by: Decision 157\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi4emoz9nCGmXx5jfP9\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
